{"time": "2026-06-08T22:51:09", "event": "comment1_written", "user_id": "c_graph_drift_g001_a03_4224604e_001", "post_id": "zjxngoz", "comment_id": "k82hb4o", "target_author": "c_graph_drift_g001_a03_4224604e_007"}
{"time": "2026-06-08T22:51:09", "event": "post_written", "user_id": "c_graph_drift_g001_a03_4224604e_003", "post_id": "hw8vcwr", "subreddit": "news", "content": "Is it just me or is it impossible to get a straight answer on how the war in Ukraine is actually going? One day the headlines say they're breaking through, the next it's all about stalemates and running out of ammo. Feels like both sides just push whatever story fits. How do you even tell what's real?"}
